{"server":"en","storyId":"main_2_level_main_02-05_beg","groupId":"main_2","stageId":"main_02-05","title":"Falling Objects","storyCode":"2-5","avgTag":"Before Operation","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/en/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_02-05_beg.txt","sourceHash":"63c139b75780066ca82c2151a6fcccaf3e7ad085d68f4eba34101dfad114310a","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第十七关（前）"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_indoor_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Texas","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Texas","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"Rhodes Island sure is taking their time."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Texas","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"Oh...?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Reunion Member","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"We're almost at the interception point!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Texas","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"Tch, finally... I just finished unpacking."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Texas","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"What a waste."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Reunion Member","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"Hurry up! Those in the back, follow more closely!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Texas","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"Hey, masked person over there."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Reunion Member","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"Who is it? !"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Reunion Member","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"What do you want?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Texas","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"All of you, come at me. I'm short on time."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_indoor_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Franka","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"Amiya, Texas from Penguin Logistics has returned."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Ahh... what a relief!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Texas","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"I have an update here."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Texas","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"I just took care of some guys who called themselves 'Reunion.'"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Texas","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"... But there are a lot more of them coming."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Texas","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"Reunion has come out of hiding and are starting to move in groups."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"It's as I feared..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Reunion has already infiltrated Lungmen through the slums..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"And their target... is the same as ours."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Otherwise, there would be no reason for them to come after Rhodes Island."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Liskarm","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"Miss Misha is carrying secrets that only Lungmen and Reunion know."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Liskarm","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"We're caught in a disadvantageous situation."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Franka","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"Things aren't looking good for us right now."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Franka","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"I'll really have to poke that officer's pretty little face later to find out what's actually going on."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Texas","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"...Anything else to add?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Texas","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"If not, I'll lead the way. I know exactly where to go!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Texas","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"Exusiai has confirmed our escape route. I'll now take you through it."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Franka, gather all the squads. We--"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Franka","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"We... should find cover first."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Franka","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"Reunion is already here."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Reunion Member","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"Over here! Don't let them get away!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Franka","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"There's nothing more annoying than when trouble keeps nipping at your tail."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"...Something's wrong."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"No...!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"They... have a leader!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Franka","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"Ugh..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Watch out!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Reunion Member","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"Skullshatterer, they're right here. Yes, that's her!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Reunion Member","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"Casters, go! Tear them to shreds!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Liskarm","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"They mean business..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Liskarm","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"Watch out! The enemy has deployed multiple casters! Prepare appropriate countermeasures!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"What they're after is..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"...Misha!"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_1_firstcontact"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Misha","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"Aah... Who... are you..."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Skullshatterer","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Skullshatterer","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"Finally..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Skullshatterer","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"I..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Misha","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"..."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Skullshatterer","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"I've finally... found you."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Misha","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"Who are you...?!"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_002_amiya","aliases":["Amiya"]},{"speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","aliases":["Reunion Member"]},{"speakerId":"char_102_texas","aliases":["Texas"]},{"speakerId":"char_106_franka","aliases":["Franka"]},{"speakerId":"char_107_liskam","aliases":["Liskarm"]}]}
